      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03141",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "大概黑子也下定决心，强下123至129。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Black too had probably made up his mind, and forced moves 123 through 129.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03141",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "黑子这种下法，在细棋里是常见的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This way of playing by Black is common in a close game.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03141",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "这是决胜的一种气势。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This is a kind of momentum that decides the victory.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03141",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "吴六段这样解说。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Wu, sixth dan, explained it this way.",
